{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Blocks is a groundbreaking music composition app for Mac, Windows and Linux. You simply place blocks of sound anywhere on the grid, connect them together and play! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a beautifully <strong>animated</strong> experience that really brings out the <strong>visual character</strong> of sounds<i> \u2014 (kind of like synesthesia).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can add <strong>'Control Blocks' </strong>to your sequence that act as modifiers for speed, time, randomization and more. Using these tools, you can <strong>create intricate musical machines</strong> that loop in interesting ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who is it for? Can I use it if I'm not a musician?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Blocks is for <strong>anyone</strong> who wants to dive into music production, whether you're a child, non-musician, gamer or a professional music producer \u2014 it has something for everyone. The workflow is super <strong>intuitive</strong> and <strong>playful</strong> <i>\u2014 no prior music experience needed.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3431440?t=1753520779","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3431440?t=1753520779","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431440/2f0c071708da2421403332dc4139df1f57b58c1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753520779","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431440/2f0c071708da2421403332dc4139df1f57b58c1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753520779","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Blocks is a groundbreaking music composition app for Mac, Windows and Linux. You simply place blocks of sound anywhere on the grid, connect them together and play! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a beautifully <strong>animated</strong> experience that really brings out the <strong>visual character</strong> of sounds<i> \u2014 (kind of like synesthesia).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can add <strong>'Control Blocks' </strong>to your sequence that act as modifiers for speed, time, randomization and more. Using these tools, you can <strong>create intricate musical machines</strong> that loop in interesting ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who is it for? Can I use it if I'm not a musician?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Blocks is for <strong>anyone</strong> who wants to dive into music production, whether you're a child, non-musician, gamer or a professional music producer \u2014 it has something for everyone. The workflow is super <strong>intuitive</strong> and <strong>playful</strong> <i>\u2014 no prior music experience needed.</i></p>","developers":["Nazaray"],"genres":[{"description":"Audio Production","id":"52"},{"description":"Education","id":"54"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431440/header.jpg?t=1753520779","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br><